<title>USA: Genovese Drug Stores Q2 shr up at $0.16.</title>
<headline>Genovese Drug Stores Q2 shr up at $0.16.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>GENOVESE DRUG STORES, INC.</p>
<p>		    SECOND QUARTER ENDED (12 WEEKS)</p>
<p>				     AUG 16, 1996	  AUG 18, 1995</p>
<p> SALES			     $155,792,000	  $138,266,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME			   1,816,000	     1,273,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME PER COMMON SHARE	    .16		  .12(a)</p>
<p>AVERAGE NUMBER OF COMMON</p>
<p>  SHARES OUTSTANDING	     11,105,000	 11,064,000(a)</p>
<p>FIRST HALF ENDED (28 WEEKS)</p>
<p>				  AUG 16, 1996	     AUG 18, 1995</p>
<p> SALES			  $356,615,000	     $317,249,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME			3,101,000	     2,816,000(b)</p>
<p> NET INCOME PER COMMON SHARE	 .28		  .25(a)(b)</p>
<p>AVERAGE NUMBER OF COMMON</p>
<p>  SHARES OUTSTANDING	  11,105,000	    11,060,000(a)</p>
<p>NOTE: Adjusted retroactively to reflect the effect of a 10 percent stock dividend distributed January 4, 1996.</p>
<p>(b) Includes $722,000 or $.07 per common share from a gain on the sale of the nursing home division.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
